# Publisher sites that reject automated requests. The links are valid in a browser;
# they return 403/400 to a link checker, so checking them tells us nothing.
https://dl\.acm\.org/.*
https://direct\.mit\.edu/.*
https://www\.sciencedirect\.com/.*
https://www\.deepdyve\.com/.*
# George Moody's page on ecg.mit.edu times out to automated requests. The PhysioNet
# citations point at it, so the cards keep the URL as PhysioNet gives it.
http://ecg\.mit\.edu/.*
